Ming-3.0-TTS recipes for GB10
Copyright 2026 0mao0

This repository documents and scripts how to serve
inclusionAI/Ming-3.0-tts-tiny on a single NVIDIA GB10 with vLLM-Omni: the
ten-stream deployment profile, streaming proxy, systemd units, probes,
benchmarks, and an optional token-protected public route.

Built on vLLM-Omni, Copyright 2026 vLLM-Omni contributors,
https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-omni, licensed under the Apache License
2.0. The deployment pins the head of PR #9198, an unmerged draft; no engine
source is redistributed here.

Model weights are not redistributed. The model is
inclusionAI/Ming-3.0-tts-tiny, MIT License; see README.md for sources.

This repository is unofficial and is not endorsed by inclusionAI or the
vLLM-Omni authors.
